1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:04,098
But you're the one
who asked to stay with me.

2
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,914
I think… I should just stay
at my friend's place instead.

3
00:00:12,914 --> 00:00:14,408
Wait.

4
00:00:15,502 --> 00:00:21,743
I remember Gun being suspicious last night—
about who slept in his room.

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,978
What do you mean?

6
00:00:23,978 --> 00:00:26,066
You think I didn't notice?

7
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:32,040
Your behavior was strange, Earth.

8
00:00:32,232 --> 00:00:34,856
I wasn't feeling well…

9
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:40,686
Not feeling well?
You were perfectly fine last night.

10
00:00:42,079 --> 00:00:44,154
Ow— that hurts!

11
00:00:46,144 --> 00:00:48,912
Just as I thought…

12
00:00:48,912 --> 00:00:50,010
Thought what?

13
00:00:51,585 --> 00:00:56,459
When Gun gets drunk,
he sleeps around with anyone.

14
00:00:58,084 --> 00:00:59,412
That's not true, P'.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,303
It's not like that…

16
00:01:03,303 --> 00:01:06,000
Not like what?
You know Gun—

17
00:01:06,735 --> 00:01:10,880
When he's drunk,
he sleeps with whoever's around.

18
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:14,385
That's why I took you out
for a ride last night.

19
00:01:14,601 --> 00:01:17,202
But since you survived the first night,

20
00:01:17,202 --> 00:01:19,153
I thought everything was fine.

21
00:01:19,882 --> 00:01:21,219
Turns out I was wrong.

22
00:01:21,899 --> 00:01:25,199
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

23
00:01:25,199 --> 00:01:30,642
Honestly, I didn't know either.
He normally doesn't like guys.

24
00:01:31,206 --> 00:01:33,222
When he's with me, he never does anything.

25
00:01:34,084 --> 00:01:35,280
He always passes out first.

26
00:01:35,802 --> 00:01:40,471
But if it's a girl?
None of them get away.

27
00:01:40,471 --> 00:01:43,441
That's why Maprang hates it.

28
00:01:44,817 --> 00:01:50,380
Hey, don't think too much.
Losing it once won't kill you.

29
00:01:51,342 --> 00:01:52,422
What are you even saying?

30
00:01:54,097 --> 00:01:57,529
Just stay here tonight.
If you need anything—

31
00:01:57,529 --> 00:02:00,549
Let me know.
If you're hungry, grab anything from the fridge.

32
00:02:00,682 --> 00:02:01,579
Eat whatever you want. Don't be shy.
